Package: strawberry-remote
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Leopold List <leo@zudiewiener.com>
Installed-Size: 938
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1 (>= 3.3.1), libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.10.2), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.1.2), libqt6network6 (>= 6.4.0), libqt6protobuf6 (>= 6.8.2), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.3.0), libstdc++6 (>= 14)
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/llist/strawberryRemoteV3
Description: Qt remote control client for Strawberry Music Player
 StrawberryRemote is a Qt6-based desktop client that connects to
 Strawberry Music Player's network remote feature over TCP, allowing
 playback control and playlist management from another machine on the
 local network.
 .
 Supports optional token-based authentication when enabled on the
 Strawberry server.
